sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite: CSMS supports setting energy limits
    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite: Test System has TxCtrlr.SupportedLimits containing maxEnergy
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Execute Reusable State EVConnectedPreSession

    CS->>CSMS: TransactionEventRequest (eventType = Started, triggerReason = ChargingStateChanged, idToken.idToken = <Configured valid_idtoken_idtoken>, idToken.type = <Configured valid_idtoken_type>, evse.id = <Configured evseId>, evse.connectorId = <Configured connectorId>, transactionInfo.transactionId = <transactionId>, transactionInfo.chargingState = Charging, transactionInfo.transactionLimit omitted)
    CSMS-->>CS: TransactionEventResponse (idTokenInfo.status = Accepted, transactionLimit.maxEnergy = <Configured energy limit>)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: idTokenInfo.status must be Accepted<br>transactionLimit.maxEnergy must be <Configured energy limit><br>transactionLimit.maxTime must be omitted<br>transactionLimit.maxCost must be omitted

    CS->>CSMS: TransactionEventRequest (triggerReason = LimitSet, transactionInfo.transactionLimit.maxEnergy = <Configured energy limit>)
    CSMS-->>CS: TransactionEventResponse (transactionLimit omitted)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: transactionLimit must be omitted

    CS->>CSMS: TransactionEventRequest (eventType = Updated, triggerReason = EnergyLimitReached, evse.id = <Configured evseId>, evse.connectorId = <Configured connectorId>, transactionInfo.transactionId = <transactionId>, transactionInfo.transactionLimit.maxEnergy = <Configured energy limit>, transactionLimit.maxTime omitted, transactionLimit.maxCost omitted, transactionInfo.chargingState = SuspendedEVSE)
    CSMS-->>CS: TransactionEventResponse
